    <div class="container">
      <div class="centrale-block fade-in">
        <div class="centrale-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Alarm receiving centres</span>
          <h2>Delegate your alarm verifications <em>in a single email</em></h2>
          <p>Integration via structured email: dispatch an Edgward agent from your existing platform, with no software surcharge or bespoke development.</p>
          <ul class="centrale-features">
            <li>Integration with no additional development</li>
            <li>Full coverage of French-speaking Switzerland</li>
            <li>Billing per intervention</li>
            <li>Automatic intervention report</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">
            Discover the integration
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
